OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 6 MAY
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GFrom Edinburgh's Usher Hall, the
OL,6,     GScottish Chamber Orchestra
OL,7,     Gconducted by Riccardo Minasi
OL,8,     Gplays Mozart's Requiem and
OL,9,     GHaydn's 'Mass In Time of War'.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: The Insect Singers
OL,11,     GThe Essay revels in the
OL,12,     Gmusicality and din of Earth's
OL,13,     Gloudest insect singers. Cicada
OL,14,     GSummer Song. Celebrated in verse,
OL,15,     Gsculpture and myth - from Japan
OL,16,     Gand China to Ancient Greece.
OL,17,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GHannah Peel presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
